hor":"胡应麟","text":"谈棋说剑更呼卢，绛蜡烧残白玉壶。\n痛饮不须愁禁夜，主人曾是旧金吾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":19031,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病目初起汪象先太学以玉簪十二馈我即取小军持承露分贮几上觉茅斋秋色种种撩人报以口号二 其一","author":"胡应麟","text":"双眼婆娑病色含，不禁秋梦绕江南。\n风流最是王公子，满把霜林赠玉簪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":19032,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病目初起汪象先太学以玉簪十二馈我即取小军持承露分贮几上觉茅斋秋色种种撩人报以口号二 其二","author":"胡应麟","text":"荏苒秋光遍六街，玉妃联袂到空斋。\n军持满插文园露，何似华堂十二钗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":19033,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜饮仁夫馆大醉吐顿因借所服绿衣归诗谢之","author":"胡应麟","text":"五斗醒来恣所如，幕天席地坐蘧庐。\n酒阑人静披衣出，满路晨钟下玉除。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":19034,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"马上望天宁寺浮屠作","author":"胡应麟","text":"十层珠瓦乱云齐，百丈金身落日低。\n几许慈恩高刹上，千秋惟睹少陵题。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":19035,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登玉华峰寺西山绝顶处余夜宿其中题此绝于岩石","author":"胡应麟","text":"绝顶秋光万壑悬，青萍摇曳乱云前。\n峰头五夜聊伸足，莫讶孤星帝座眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":19036,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖上","author":"胡应麟","text":"风起平林月色低，飞香十里禁城西。\n不知人在清凉国，万朵芙蓉夹大堤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":19037,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题董体仁壁间","author":"胡应麟","text":"二十年前灞水傍，垆头晨夕纵清狂。\n天南海北凋零尽，赢得君家玉树长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":19038,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柬苏叔大乞黄花鱼","author":"胡应麟","text":"徙倚东篱日渐舂，南山何处见秋容。\n凭君乞取罗浮脍，吟望飞云四百峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":19039,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题五首戏恼李王元三子 其一","author":"胡应麟","text":"珠箔银屏玳瑁梁，何人低语合欢床。\n金笼鹦鹉浑多事，窗外频呼李十郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":19040,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题五首戏恼李王元三子 其二","author":"胡应麟","text":"金水桥边白玉堂，人人争问薛家娘。\n青衣屏后褰帘看，不是王郎是李郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":19041,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题五首戏恼李王元三子 其三","author":"胡应麟","text":"文君颜色斗谁强，十样鸾笺总在唐。\n一片蒹葭秋似水，月明何处问元郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":19042,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题五首戏恼李王元三子 其四","author":"胡应麟","text":"红牙敲彻总寻常，指点倾城在末行。\n歌到玉门杨柳句，诸君端合拜胡郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":19043,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题五首戏恼李王元三子 其五","author":"胡应麟","text":"风流千古擅词场，濯锦江头正夕阳。\n花发小桃寒食夜，莫将魂梦恼元郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":19044,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"射所墙东书事","author":"胡应麟","text":"门掩湘筠翠色虚，将雏语燕入庭除。\n不知金犊何时返，閒坐樱桃第四株。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":19045,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"歌者陈邵两生别余二十馀载忽与遇长安邸中一曲辞去","author":"胡应麟","text":"廿载桃花瀫水头，腰肢垂老尚风流。\n相逢一笑番成别，月落参横下酒楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":19046,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶题","author":"胡应麟","text":"独捲纱窗昼漏迟，春风含笑画蛾眉。\n东邻预订黄昏约，夜合花香月上时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":19047,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春闺曲","author":"胡应麟","text":"春衫斜捲越罗轻，女伴西园作队行。\n荡子不归三月暮，百花深处乱啼莺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":19048,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋闺曲","author":"胡应麟","text":"沉水香销白玉壶，薰笼斜倚月明孤。\n狂夫尚作潇湘客，夜夜金风落井梧